.TH MERCURY 1 "" "Mercury Writer 1.6.8" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
mercury \- Mercury Library, writing editors and manuscript synchronization
.SH "MERCURY"
.nf
usage: mercury [-h] [--editor {nvim,nvim-desk,mini,external}] [--split]
               {library,projects,ls,trash,status,reset,conflicts,resolve,edit,recover,remove-local,delete,link,open,sync,doctor} ...

Mercury Writer · one manuscript, browser and terminal views

positional arguments:
  {library,projects,ls,trash,status,reset,conflicts,resolve,edit,recover,remove-local,delete,link,open,sync,doctor}

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --editor {nvim,nvim-desk,mini,external}
                        mini: built-in editor (default); nvim: your usual Neovim;
                        nvim-desk: custom Mercury layout
  --split
.fi
